# Base URL of the Django API. Inlined into the client bundle at BUILD time
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_*), so production builds must set it in the build environment.
# Defaults to the local dev backend when unset.
#
# Its origin is also baked into the Content-Security-Policy `connect-src` in
# next.config.ts at build time; a wrong value makes the browser block every API
# request. Set it in the build environment.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
